OL,3,AGTA 6 soundtrack reveal revives digital
OL,4,Arelease debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reveal of a Grand Theft Auto 6
OL,7,Fsoundtrack album has reignited a debate
OL,8,Fover the decision not to release the
OL,9,Fgame on disc.
OL,11,FDeveloper Rockstar Games announced a
OL,12,F34-track compilation, set to release on
OL,13,FCD and vinyl on the same day as the
OL,14,Fhighly anticipated video game.
OL,16,FThe company says it will include
OL,17,Foriginal music from a "genre-defying
OL,18,Froster of the most exciting artists in
OL,19,Fthe world" including rapper Travis
OL,20,FScott, country singer Morgan Wallen and
OL,21,FUK singer PinkPantheress.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
