OL,3,AGTA 6 soundtrack reveal revives digital
OL,4,Arelease debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut some fans have pointed out the
OL,7,F"irony" of putting out a physical
OL,8,Fedition of the album following its
OL,9,Fcontroversial decision for a
OL,10,Fdigital-only release of the game.
